#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:2
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:4
msgid ""
"This page collects questions the LMCache community asks most often, "
"together with the answers given by project maintainers. The community "
"maintains this page: questions arrive through Slack, GitHub, and "
"community channels such as Xiaohongshu, and are collected here."
msgstr "本页汇总 LMCache 社区最常被问到的问题，以及项目维护者给出的回答。本页由社区维护：问题来自 Slack、GitHub 以及小红书等社区渠道，在此集中整理。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:9
msgid ""
"The English page is the source of this content. Translations are "
"maintained as gettext catalogs under ``docs/source/locale/`` and are "
"published alongside the English page. See "
":doc:`../developer_guide/contributing` for how to contribute a question, "
"an answer, or a translation."
msgstr "英文页面是本内容的源文本。翻译以 gettext catalog 的形式维护在 ``docs/source/locale/`` 下，并与英文页面一同发布 —— 关于如何贡献问题、答案或翻译，请参见 :doc:`../developer_guide/contributing`。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:15
msgid ""
"Some answers below are marked as needing maintainer confirmation. They "
"record what was said in a community discussion, but they are incomplete, "
"undated, or not yet checked against the current code. Treat these answers"
" as provisional. Where a reference link is given, use the reference "
"instead."
msgstr "下面有几条回答被标记为需要维护者确认。它们记录了社区讨论中的说法，但内容不完整、没有注明日期，或尚未与当前代码核对。请将其视为暂定内容；如果给出了参考链接，请以链接为准。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:21
msgid "Project and roadmap"
msgstr "项目与路线图"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:24
msgid ""
"Why was Python chosen as LMCache's implementation language, and is there "
"a plan to switch to another language?"
msgstr "lmc 最初为什么选用 Python 作为开发语言呢，后续有计划切换到其他语言么？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:26
msgid ""
"The AI ecosystem is still mostly Python. vLLM and SGLang are both written"
" in Python. Python is also quick to learn and friendly to newcomers, so "
"LMCache chose Python as well."
msgstr "整个 AI 生态还是以 Python 为主的，像 vLLM、SGLang 都是 Python 的，而且上手也快，对新人友好，所以 LMCache 也是选择用 Python 实现的。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:30
msgid ""
"Switching is possible, and some people have already rewritten the LMCache"
" server side in C++ or Rust. However, the core of LMCache will remain "
"mostly Python, to stay consistent with the surrounding ecosystem."
msgstr "但完全可以，而且已经有人用 C++/Rust 重写过 LMCache 的 server 端，但 LMCache 的主体还是会以 Python 为主，保持与整个生态一致。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:34
msgid ""
"*Answered by* `@maobaolong <https://github.com/maobaolong>`__. *First "
"asked on Xiaohongshu.*"
msgstr "*由* `@maobaolong <https://github.com/maobaolong>`__ *回答。首次提问来自小红书。*"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:37
msgid "Which models does LMCache support?"
msgstr "LMCache 支持的模型有哪些？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:39
msgid ""
"Officially supported models are listed in the `LMCache recipes "
"<https://docs.lmcache.ai/recipes/index.html>`__. That page is updated as "
"support for each new model is added."
msgstr "官方支持的模型会更新到 `LMCache recipes <https://docs.lmcache.ai/recipes/index.html>`__，并随支持情况持续更新。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:43
msgid "*Answered by* `@maobaolong <https://github.com/maobaolong>`__."
msgstr "*由* `@maobaolong <https://github.com/maobaolong>`__ *回答。*"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:46
msgid "Deploying on Kubernetes"
msgstr "在 Kubernetes 上部署"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:49
msgid ""
"Why does LMCache need its own Kubernetes operator when projects such as "
"llm-d exist?"
msgstr "lmcache k8s operator 这些的生态定位，为什么有 llm-d 之类的，lmcache 还需要 lmcache k8s operator？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:51
msgid ""
"LMCache MP (multiprocess) mode runs as a DaemonSet on Kubernetes, which "
"needs extra management logic. LMCache also has a coordinator, plugins, "
"and other components that all need an extra control plane to operate "
"them. For these reasons, the project currently maintains its own separate"
" Kubernetes operator."
msgstr "LMCache MP（多进程）模式本身在 k8s 部署时作为一个 DaemonSet，需要额外的管理逻辑。同时，我们也有 coordinator、plugin 等等各个部件，都需要额外的控制面来进行操控。所以目前我们维护一个自己独立的 k8s operator。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:56 ../../source/community/faq.rst:106
#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:129
msgid "*Answered by* `@ApostaC <https://github.com/ApostaC>`__."
msgstr "*由* `@ApostaC <https://github.com/ApostaC>`__ *回答。*"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:59
msgid "Does deploying LMCache on Kubernetes require special permissions?"
msgstr "lmcache 通过 k8s 部署是否需要开启某些特殊的权限？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:61
msgid ""
"Yes. This is known behavior today, and these permissions exist mainly to "
"support the cross-GPU KV Cache sharing feature. If you do not grant these"
" permissions, deployment fails. The project plans to offer an approach "
"that does not require special permissions in a future release."
msgstr "是的。这是一个目前的已知行为，主要是为了跨 GPU 的 KV Cache 共享特性。未授予这些权限时部署会失败。这部分我们之后会推出不需要特殊权限的方案。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:67
msgid "Storage and hardware acceleration"
msgstr "存储与硬件加速"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:70
msgid "Does LMCache support GDS and GDR?"
msgstr "lmcache 是否有计划支持 GDS 和 GDR？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:72
msgid ""
"LMCache supports GDS (GPUDirect Storage) today, and the community "
"recently merged a pull request that adds uGDS support. GDR (GPUDirect "
"RDMA) is on the roadmap."
msgstr "目前已经支持 GDS（GPUDirect Storage），并且社区刚合入一个 PR，支持 uGDS。GDR（GPUDirect RDMA）目前在 roadmap 中。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:77
msgid "What performance gains come from enabling GDS?"
msgstr "开启 GDS 后带来的性能收益数据如何？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Needs maintainer confirmation.** The community discussion pointed to "
"the uGDS paper as a source of measurements, because those tests were run "
"against LMCache. No figures or citation were recorded. This answer needs "
"a specific reference and specific numbers before it is useful."
msgstr "**需要维护者确认。** 社区讨论中提到可以引用 uGDS 论文中的测量数据，理由是其测试基于 LMCache，但没有记录具体数字或引用出处。这条回答需要补充明确的参考来源和数据后才有价值。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:86
msgid "Does multi-hardware support require hardware features such as IPC events?"
msgstr "多硬件支持，是否需要硬件支持 IPC event 之类的？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:88
msgid ""
"This depends on the mode. EngineDriven mode does not require IPC (inter-"
"process communication) events. LMCacheDriven mode does require them. "
"Moore Threads MUSA currently supports LMCacheDriven mode."
msgstr "取决于模式。EngineDriven mode 不需要 IPC（进程间通信）event，LMCacheDriven mode 是需要的。目前摩尔线程 MUSA 支持 LMCacheDriven mode。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:93
msgid "CacheBlend"
msgstr "CacheBlend"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:96
msgid ""
"Is CacheBlend only in a commercial version, and when will it be open-"
"sourced?"
msgstr "CacheBlend 目前是不是只有商业化版本？什么时候开源？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:98
msgid ""
"The core team is currently focused on support for the latest vLLM. The "
"code is not yet ready to be open-sourced."
msgstr "目前核心团队主要在做最新的 vLLM 支持，目前代码还没有完全准备好开源。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:102
msgid ""
"**Needs maintainer confirmation.** The original answer said that an open-"
"source version was expected \"this quarter\", but that statement was not "
"dated, so the timeline cannot be relied on. A current target date is "
"needed."
msgstr "**需要维护者确认。** 原始回答提到预计“这个季度”会有一个开源版本，但该说法没有注明日期，因此时间点不可依赖。需要补充当前的目标日期。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:109
msgid "Does CacheBlend support linear attention models?"
msgstr "CacheBlend 是否支持 linear attention 的模型？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Needs maintainer confirmation.** The community raised this question, "
"but no answer was recorded, apart from a reference to an article on "
"Xiaohongshu. That article was not identified."
msgstr "**需要维护者确认。** 社区提出了这个问题，但没有记录到回答，只留下一个指向小红书某篇文章的线索，且该文章未被具体指明。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:117
msgid "KV Cache behavior and control"
msgstr "KV Cache 行为与控制"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:120
msgid ""
"A conversation still has its context a week later. Does that mean KV "
"Cache is being used?"
msgstr "一周之后，一个会话的上下文仍然保留，是否用到了 KV Cache？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:122
msgid ""
"Not necessarily. The agent client stores the context text and sends it "
"with each request. That behavior is unrelated to KV Cache."
msgstr "不一定。context 文本在 agent 客户端中保存，提问时一起带过来，这与 KV Cache 无关。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:125
msgid ""
"LMCache can provide features such as pin, which forces a KV Cache entry "
"to stay in the system. Pinning is what guarantees that a given "
"conversation hits the KV Cache."
msgstr "LMCache 可以提供 pin 之类的功能，强制 KV Cache 保存在系统中，这样就可以保证这个会话可以命中 KV Cache。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:132
msgid "Can LMCache control KV Cache based on the semantics of a request?"
msgstr "LMCache 是否提供能力，根据一些语义可以操控 KV Cache？"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:134
msgid ""
"This question came from a user who wanted sub-agent conversations "
"excluded from the KV Cache, keeping only the main conversation's KV "
"Cache."
msgstr "这个问题来自一位希望把一些 sub agent 的对话不要记住 KV Cache、只需要保留主会话的 KV Cache 的用户。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:137
msgid ""
"inProcess mode previously supported reading an extra parameter on a "
"request that indicated whether caching should be disabled. MP mode has "
"not yet ported this feature, but it could be added with little effort."
msgstr "inProcess mode 之前支持过解析 request 带一个 extra param 来指示是否 disable cache，但目前 MP mode 暂未移植该功能，可以很快支持。"

#: ../../source/community/faq.rst:141
msgid ""
"In MP mode, the MP coordinator module already supports lookup, prefetch, "
"pin, and delete. It also supports re-synchronization after a restart, "
"checkpointing, and related operations."
msgstr "目前 MP 模式下有 mp coordinator 模块，已经支持了 lookup、prefetch、pin、delete 等功能，也支持重启之后重新同步、checkpointing 等功能。"

